  "body": "### Summary\n`MessageTitleToneTests` (dark case) fails on CI again even with #704's fix (#1110, up to 3 redone renders): on 2026-11-20 two unrelated ready runs hit three blank `ImageRenderer` renders in a row and failed. Each red run costs a macOS re-run. Make the test reliable without loosening what it checks.\n\n### Observed (2026-11-20)\n- #1281, head 53c98e6a, ready run: `#704 blank render redone (try 1/2/3, corner 0.0 0.0 0.0)`, then `↳ three blank renders, #704`, `Self.centre(of: readSwatch, background: background) → nil` at `MessageTitleToneTests.swift:91` (argument `dark → false`). Passed on re-run.\n- #1282, head b0caf778, ready run: the same three blank renders and the same failure. Re-run pending.\n- Neither PR touches the title tone or its rendering.\n\n### Scope\n- Find why `ImageRenderer` returns a fully blank (0,0,0,0 corner) image under CI load in the dark case: render timing, the color scheme environment, or the renderer's off-screen context. #1110's retry shows three blanks in a row is now common, so the retry is not the fix.\n- Fix the cause (for example render through a hosted `UIHostingController` window like other hosted pixel tests, or wait for a non-blank render with a bounded deadline). Never skip, quarantine or loosen the colour check.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The cause is named with evidence (CI log lines).\n- [ ] 20 consecutive local runs of `MessageTitleToneTests` under CPU load pass, and the next CI ready runs show no `three blank renders` line.\n\nRelated: #704 (closed by #1110), #934 (WebContent flakes).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
